        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Logan Lerman, Shawn Christensen, Jennifer Connelly, Greg Kinnear, Lily Collins, Nat Wolff\n- Films: The Three Musketeers, The Perks of Being a Wallflower, Noah, Fury, Indignation, Sidney Hall, Stuck in Love\n- TV Series: Rick and Morty\n- Songs: Between the Bars\n\nFacts:\n- Logan Lerman played d'Artagnan in the 2011 film \"The Three Musketeers\".\n- Logan Lerman appeared in the 2012 coming-of-age drama \"The Perks of Being a Wallflower\".\n- The 2012 indie film \"Stuck in Love\" stars Jennifer Connelly, Greg Kinnear, Lily Collins, Nat Wolff, and Logan Lerman.\n- The song \"Between the Bars\" featured in the 2012 indie film \"Stuck in Love\".\n- Logan Lerman had major roles in the 2014 films \"Noah\" and \"Fury\".\n- Logan Lerman starred in the 2016 coming-of-age drama \"Indignation\".\n- \"Sidney Hall\" is a 2017 American drama film directed and co-written by Shawn Christensen.\n- Logan Lerman starred in the 2017 coming-of-age drama \"Sidney Hall\".\n- The song \"Between the Bars\" appeared in the seventh episode of season two of \"Rick and Morty\".",
